# The toolchain image GitLab's merge-request jobs run in: the digest of
# $CI_REGISTRY_IMAGE/toolchain as the toolchain-publish job pushed it, built from
# deploy/acceptance/Dockerfile. The CI/CD variable MIDGARD_TOOLCHAIN_DIGEST must equal
# the last line; every .toolchain job checks that first and fails closed when it does
# not. [VLD-ANB-MIDGARD-0043]
#
# Not yet published: run toolchain-publish from "Run pipeline" on main (docs/dev/CI.md,
# "What a GitLab instance needs"), then replace the last two lines with the two it
# prints. Until then the merge-request jobs on GitLab fail, by design.
# dockerfile-sha16: none
unpublished
